<title>USA: Rose's Oct same-store sales rose 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Rose's Oct same-store sales rose 1.5 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>DURHAM, N.C., Oct 30 (Reuter)</p>
<p>						    Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	 Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $51.0	$50.3	 +1.4	+1.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $481.0     $490.8	 -2.0	-1.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   4    weeks ended October 26   .</p>
<p>Full company name is Rose's Stores Inc</p>
</text>
